{"id":70509,"date":"2026-10-23T08:53:26","date_gmt":"2026-10-23T07:53:26","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=70509"},"modified":"2026-10-23T08:55:30","modified_gmt":"2026-10-23T07:55:30","slug":"desafio-picos-do-acor","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/desafio-picos-do-acor\/","title":{"rendered":"Desafio Picos do A\u00e7or 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Desafio Picos do A\u00e7or 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>Desafio Picos do A\u00e7or 2026<\/strong> realiza-se nos dias <strong>12 e 13 de dezembro de 2026<\/strong> em <strong>Arganil<\/strong>, distrito de <strong>Coimbra<\/strong>, percorrendo as cumeadas e aldeias serranas da emblem\u00e1tica <strong>Serra do A\u00e7or<\/strong>. O evento \u00e9 organizado pela <strong>Evolu\u00e7\u00e3o Vertical<\/strong> em colabora\u00e7\u00e3o com a <strong>C\u00e2mara Municipal de Arganil<\/strong> e as <strong>Juntas de Freguesia de Arganil e Folques<\/strong>, integrando paralelamente a mostra regional e desportiva <em>ExpoTrail A\u00e7or<\/em>.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Com centro log\u00edstico, secretariado, partidas e chegadas na <strong>Antiga Cer\u00e2mica Arganilense<\/strong> (Rua Cidade do Rio de Janeiro, Sobreiral, Arganil), o programa arranca no s\u00e1bado, 12 de dezembro, \u00e0s <strong>16h00<\/strong> com o <strong>A\u00e7or Trail Kids<\/strong> (6 aos 15 anos). No domingo, 13 de dezembro, disputam-se o <strong>Desafio Picos do A\u00e7or 32 km<\/strong> (2000 m D+, partida \u00e0s <strong>08h00<\/strong>, pontu\u00e1vel para o Circuito Distrital de Trail Longo de Coimbra da ADAC), a <strong>Caminhada do A\u00e7or 13 km<\/strong> (400 m D+, \u00e0s <strong>08h30<\/strong>), o <strong>Desafio Picos do A\u00e7or 18 km<\/strong> (1000 m D+, \u00e0s <strong>09h30<\/strong>) e o <strong>Desafio Picos do A\u00e7or 13 km<\/strong> (600 m D+, \u00e0s <strong>10h00<\/strong>).<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es decorrem de <strong>1 de setembro a 1 de dezembro de 2026<\/strong> com os valores de <strong>36,00 \u20ac<\/strong> (32 km, 600 vagas), <strong>23,00 \u20ac<\/strong> (18 km, 600 vagas), <strong>17,00 \u20ac<\/strong> (13 km, 400 vagas) e <strong>15,00 \u20ac<\/strong> (Caminhada, 100 vagas), incluindo dorsal com chip, t-shirt t\u00e9cnica (tamanho garantido at\u00e9 13 de novembro), pr\u00e9mio finisher, abastecimentos na P\u00f3voa de Folques, Monte Redondo, Selada das Eiras e Nogueira, seguro e banhos na Piscina Municipal e Escola B\u00e1sica 2,3 de Arganil. Consulta o calend\u00e1rio nacional de provas de <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/trail\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">Trail Running em Portugal<\/a>.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">12 a 13 de Dezembro de 2026<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Concelho &#038; Distrito<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Antiga Cer\u00e2mica Arganilense, Sobreiral, Arganil, Coimbra<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 