u00e7or 13 km<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 13 Dez \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 10:00 \u2022 600m D+ (586m D+ GPX)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Inscri\u00e7\u00e3o Geral:<\/strong> 17.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (01\/09 a 01\/12\/2026)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Caminhada<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Caminhada do A\u00e7or 13 km<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 13 Dez \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 08:30 \u2022 400m D+<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Inscri\u00e7\u00e3o Geral:<\/strong> 15.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (01\/09 a 01\/12\/2026)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Trail Kids<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">A\u00e7or Trail Kids (6 aos 15 anos)<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 12 Dez \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 16:00<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando se realiza o Desafio Picos do A\u00e7or 2026 e onde fica o secretariado e partida?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O Desafio Picos do A\u00e7or 2026 realiza-se nos dias <strong>12 e 13 de dezembro de 2026<\/strong>. O secretariado, as partidas e a meta localizam-se na <strong>Antiga Cer\u00e2mica Arganilense<\/strong> (Rua Cidade do Rio de Janeiro, Sobreiral, 3300-145 Arganil, coordenadas 40.219648, -8.063238).<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias, desn\u00edveis e hor\u00e1rios de partida de cada prova?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">No s\u00e1bado (12 de dezembro) realiza-se o <strong>A\u00e7or Trail Kids<\/strong> \u00e0s <strong>16h00<\/strong>. No domingo (13 de dezembro) partem o <strong>Trail Longo 32 km<\/strong> (2000 m D+) \u00e0s <strong>08h00<\/strong>, a <strong>Caminhada do A\u00e7or 13 km<\/strong> (400 m D+) \u00e0s <strong>08h30<\/strong>, o <strong>Trail Curto 18 km<\/strong> (1000 m D+) \u00e0s <strong>09h30<\/strong> e o <strong>Mini Trail 13 km<\/strong> (600 m D+) \u00e0s <strong>10h00<\/strong>.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os pre\u00e7os, vagas e prazos de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O per\u00edodo regular de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o decorre de <strong>1 de setembro a 1 de dezembro de 2026<\/strong> com os valores de <strong>36,00 \u20ac<\/strong> para os 32 km (600 vagas), <strong>23,00 \u20ac<\/strong> para os 18 km (600 vagas), <strong>17,00 \u20ac<\/strong> para os 13 km (400 vagas) e <strong>15,00 \u20ac<\/strong> para a Caminhada (100 vagas). Atletas filiados na ADAC beneficiam de 1,50 \u20ac de desconto nos 32 km.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 o tempo limite (cut-off) e o material obrigat\u00f3rio nas provas de trail?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O tempo m\u00e1ximo \u00e9 de <strong>8h00<\/strong> para os 32 km (com barreiras hor\u00e1rias \u00e0s 4h00 em Monte Redondo, 6h00 na Selada das Eiras e 7h00 em Nogueira) e de <strong>6h00<\/strong> para os 18 km (barreira \u00e0s 5h00 em Nogueira), 13 km e Caminhada. \u00c9 obrigat\u00f3rio transportar telem\u00f3vel operacional, corta-vento, apito, reservat\u00f3rio de \u00e1gua e manta de sobreviv\u00eancia (a organiza\u00e7\u00e3o n\u00e3o fornece copos descart\u00e1veis nos abastecimentos).<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os hor\u00e1rios de funcionamento do secretariado e onde h\u00e1 banhos e solo duro?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O secretariado na Antiga Cer\u00e2mica Arganilense funciona na sexta-feira (11 de dezembro, 19h00\u201321h00), no s\u00e1bado (12 de dezembro, 14h00\u201321h00) e no domingo (13 de dezembro, 06h00\u201310h00). Os banhos s\u00e3o disponibilizados nos balne\u00e1rios da Piscina Municipal de Arganil e da Escola B\u00e1sica 2,3 de Arganil (onde tamb\u00e9m existe solo duro mediante reserva por 3,00 \u20ac).<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Desafio Picos do A\u00e7or 2026\", \"startDate\": \"2026-12-12\", \"endDate\": \"2026-12-12\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.o